span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/ase-2026/davidlo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"David Lo\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/davidlo/624a4ae4-1ca4-42e5-85df-43a291f5064e/micro-avatar?1793538912000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">David Lo<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Singapore Management University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Singapore</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track/9/Beyond-Text-Matching-Towards-Reference-Free-Evaluation-for-Human-Oriented-Binary-Rev\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-ce4b34cb-7d85-438f-863d-d797ce443358').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
